  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant CHANGED_MEDIA has the value 0x800</p>
  <p><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Prim_Media" target="_blank">Prim Media</a> on the prim has changed.</p>
</p>
